{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"3aa72174529879f59c9c24a590c7f512dafc69fc78e843aed0f93864112147ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約伯的回答"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"約伯回答說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我的哀訴至今充滿苦楚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的責罰使我呻吟不止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但願我知道何處能尋見上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道怎樣去祂的居所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我好在祂面前陳明案情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滔滔不絕地為自己申辯；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我好知道祂的答覆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白祂對我說的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂會用大能與我爭辯嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不會的，祂會垂聽我的申訴，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"允許正直的人與祂理論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"審判者會讓我永遠脫罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「然而，我去東邊，祂不在那裡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我到西邊，也找不到祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在北邊工作，我看不見祂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂轉到南邊，我也看不見祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祂知道我的一舉一動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我被祂試煉後必如純金。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我緊隨祂的腳步，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守祂的道，沒有偏離。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有違背祂口中的誡命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我珍視祂的話語勝過我日用的飲食。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂獨行其事，誰能阻擋祂？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂按自己的意願行事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在我身上的計劃必然實現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂還有許多這樣的計劃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我在祂面前驚恐不安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我想起這一切，便對祂充滿恐懼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝使我心驚膽戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能者使我驚恐不安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我不會因為置身黑暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被幽暗籠罩而緘默不言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}